--dir
.
--ignore=tmp/
--ignore=vendor/
# Agent worktrees are full checkouts of this repo living inside it. Without
# this, srb parses every class and RBI twice and reports thousands of
# duplicate-definition errors that say nothing about the working tree.
--ignore=.claude/worktrees/

# Lets a controller mixin declare `requires_ancestor { ApplicationController }`
# so Sorbet resolves the controller methods it calls (params, RequestMemo#memo)
# without a per-method `T.bind(self, T.all(ActionController::Base, Mixin))`. The
# scoped-lookup modules (SceneScoped, PostScoped, …) use it; TurnstileVerification
# cannot (Devise's incomplete RBI breaks its ancestry) and keeps its T.bind.
--enable-experimental-requires-ancestor
